(10, 9, 'Waitress', 'Colombo International Hotel', '335', 'Colombo', '2 years, 2 months, 7 days', '2023-12-23', NULL, 'Guest Service: Greeting customers, guiding them to tables, and presenting menus.\r\nOrder Management: Answering questions about menu items, ingredients, or allergens, taking accurate orders, and relaying them to kitchen staff.\r\nService Delivery: Serving food and beverages, ensuring quality, and checking back with guests to ensure satisfaction.\r\nTable Maintenance: Setting up service areas, clearing dirty dishes, and maintaining a clean, orderly dining environment.', '1', '2026-03-02 16:59:47', '2026-03-02 16:59:47'),
